  "naturesmod.warning.tsunami_flood": "\u26a0 FLASH FLOOD: a wall of water %s blocks high is rushing in from the %s. Get to high ground, now!",
  "naturesmod.warning.tsunami_near": "\u26a0 The wave is almost on you! Climb as high as you can, now!",
